  "solution": "** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8ee7cdefad6faa10809144a0540569819aeddde3b2d765d6c3b1017849970e33.png] **\n\n**Given: 3 × (9 + 7 - 5) + (64 ÷ 2) - 22 + 78 - 8 × 4 = 82**\n\nAccording to the question:\n\nLet's check options one by one:\n\nOption 1) 3 and 4 \n\n 3 × (9 + 7 - 5) + (64 ÷ 2) - 22 + 78 - 8 × 4 = 82\n\n⇒ 4 × (__**9 + 7**__ - 5) + (__**64 ÷ 2**__) - 22 + 78 - __**8 × 3**__ = 82\n\n​⇒ 4 × (__16 - 5__)__** + 32 - 22 - 24**__ = 82\n\n​⇒ __**4 × 11**__ - 14 = 82\n\n⇒ 44 - 14 = 30 ≠ 82\n\nOption 2) 2 and 4\n\n 3 × (9 + 7 - 5) + (64 ÷ 2) - 22 + 78 - 8 × 4 = 82\n\n​⇒ 3 × (__**9 + 7 - 5**__) + __**(64 ÷ 4)**__ - 22 + 78 - __**8 × 2**__ = 82\n\n​⇒ __**3 × (11**____**)**__ + (6) - 22 + 78 - 16 = 82\n\n​⇒ 33 + 6 - 22 + 78 - 16 = 82\n\n​⇒ 33 + 6 - 22 + 78 - 16 = 79 ≠ 82\n\nOption 3) 64 and 78\n\n 3 × (9 + 7 - 5) + (64 ÷ 2) - 22 + 78 - 8 × 4 = 82\n\n​⇒ 3 × (__**9 + 7 - 5**__) + (__**78 ÷ 2**__) - 22 + 64 - __**8 × 4**__ = 82\n\n​⇒ 3 × (11) + (39) - 22 + 64 - 32 = 82\n\n​⇒ __**33**____** + (39**____**)**__ - 22 + __**64 - 32**__ = 82\n\n​**⇒ **** 72 - 22 + 32 = 82**\n\nOption 4) 7 and 5\n\n 3 × (9 + 7 - 5) + (64 ÷ 2) - 22 + 78 - 8 × 4 = 82​\n\n​⇒ 3 × (__**9 + 5 - 7**__) + (__**64 ÷ 2**__) - 22 + 78 - __**8 × 4**__ = 82\n\n​⇒ __**3 × (7)**__ + (32) - 22 + 78 - 32 = 82\n\n⇒ __**21**____** + 32**__ - 22 + 78 - 32 = 82\n\n⇒ 53 - 22 + 78 - 32 = 77 ≠ 823×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82** **Hence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82\" id=\"MathJax-Element-4-Frame\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\">[Math Processing Error]3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82\" id=\"MathJax-Element-1-Frame\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\">3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=823×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82 3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82 3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82 3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82 3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×3×(9+7−5)+(64÷2)−22+78−8×4=82\" id=\"MathJax-Element-5-Frame\" role=\"pres